  "readmeFile": "docs/README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Patch notes for 145.0.219\n\nThese patch notes summarize the changes from version 144.0.155.\n\nAdded 11 new APIs:\n* NptRecurrency.ValidateRecurringNpts (POST /api/data/npt/{taskId}/recurring/settings/validate)\n* NptRecurrency.UpdateRecurringNpts (PUT /api/data/npt/{taskId}/recurring/settings)\n* ProjectChargeCode.UpdateProjectChargeCode (PUT /api/data/projects/chargecodes/{chargeCodeId})\n* ProjectChargeCode.DeleteProjectChargeCode (DELETE /api/data/projects/chargecodes/{chargeCodeId})\n* ProjectFolder.CreateProjectFolder (POST /api/data/project-folders)\n* ProjectFolder.UpdateProjectFolder (PUT /api/data/project-folders/{projectFolderId})\n* ProjectFolder.DeleteProjectFolder (DELETE /api/data/project-folders/{projectFolderId})\n* ProjectStatus.UpdateProjectStatus (PUT /api/data/projects/statuses/{projectStatusId})\n* ProjectStatus.DeleteProjectStatus (DELETE /api/data/projects/statuses/{projectStatusId})\n* TaskRecurrency.ValidateRecurringTasks (POST /api/data/tasks/{taskId}/recurring/settings/validate)\n* TaskRecurrency.UpdateRecurringTasks (PUT /api/data/tasks/{taskId}/recurring/settings)\n\nRenamed 5 old APIs:\n* Renamed 'Timesheet.QueryTimeSheets' to 'Timesheet.QueryTimeEntries'\n* Renamed 'Timesheet.ReturnsActiveAdminTasksThatAreUsedToReportTime' to 'Timesheet.RetrieveAdministrativeTasks'\n* Renamed 'Timesheet.SubmitResourceTimeSheetForApproval' to 'Timesheet.SubmitTimeSheet'\n* Renamed 'Timesheet.ApproveResourceTimeSheetApprovalRequest' to 'Timesheet.ApproveTimeSheet'\n* Renamed 'Timesheet.RejectResourceTimeSheetApprovalRequest' to 'Timesheet.RejectTimeSheet'\n\nChanges to data models:\n* ProjectDto: Added new field `ownerId`\n* TaskCreateDto: Added new field `index`",
